From: VIKINGYFY <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:57:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] storage: publish local payloads atomically and check Close

Writing directly to the final path can expose a partially written body,
and streaming saves currently discard file Close errors.

Write local FS payloads to a same-directory private temporary file, Sync
and Close it, then Rename and sync the parent directory. Remove temporary
files on failure and preserve the previously published file until rename.
Propagate streaming Close failures. Add explicit local directory removal
for whole-record GC while preserving the other storage backend paths.

Base-Commit: 0896305eeee89435049575d55a813f72901f703b

